export anchor KawaiiStyle:
    number: 172
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Kawaii
    idea: The dashboard is a sheet of cute stickers, where pastel blobs with little faces hold the totals, every corner is round, sparkles float behind, and each status wears its own face on its own shape.
    base: light
    palette:
        cream: #fff7fb, the page, chat bubbles and fields
        strawberryMilk: #ffd6e7, a card, the current tab and the overdue pill
        sky: #d4ecff, a card and a blob
        mint: #ccf3e2, a card and a blob
        lavender: #e6deff, a card, the search field and rows
        butter: #fff1b8, a card and a blob
        peach: #ffe0cc, a card and the avatar
        plum: #4a2350, text, outlines and sticker shadows
        softPlum: #6e4a72, dates and hints
        hotPink: #c2185b, the primary button and the candy stripe
        star: #ffd34d, sparkles and heading stars, never text
        green: #17694a, On track
        caramel: #8c4a00, At risk
        cherry: #b3123f, Behind and overdue
        grape: #5b3fd6, the dashed focus ring
    type:
        One rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Hiragino Maru
        Gothic ProN, Varela Round, Nunito, Quicksand, Arial Rounded MT
        Bold, system-ui. Total figures are 52px at 800, the greeting 34px
        at 800, card names and headings 20 to 22px at 800, body 15 to 16px
        and chips 13px at 800.
    layout:
        A white pill header sticker holds a smiling star mark with the
        brand, a lavender pill search, a hot pink New project button, a
        round bell and a peach avatar. Below it the nav is a centred row of
        pill stickers, Home in pink with a sparkle. A white cloud character
        with blush and a sparkle speaks a speech bubble holding Good
        morning, Mara!, the date and a pink overdue pill. Four pastel blob
        characters, each with a different shape and mood face, hold the
        totals, the overdue blob worried with a sweat drop. Six project
        cards in three columns, each in its own pastel, show a department
        chip, a status face chip, the name, a candy-striped pill bar and
        percent, tasks and due date. Below sit a white chart sticker with
        pill-shaped bars outlined in plum, lavender last week and pink this
        week, with a star beside the top day, and a What's new panel of
        chat bubbles with initial avatars. Headings carry a small star.
        Cards go to two columns, then one, and the chart scrolls sideways
        on phones.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 18px gaps between stickers, 28 to 36px between sections.
    density: Airy and playful. Big soft shapes, one idea per sticker.
    corners: Round everything. 26 to 28px cards, full pills for buttons, fields, chips and bars, and wobbly blob radii on the totals.
    borders: A 2.5 to 3px plum outline on every shape, like a die-cut sticker.
    shadows: A hard plum drop of 4 to 6px straight down, with no blur.
    icons:
        Faces on shapes beside words. A smiling circle for On track, a
        rounded triangle with a wobbly mouth for At risk, a rounded square
        with a sad mouth for Behind and a star with a bang for Overdue.
        Total blobs have happy, busy, worried and proud faces.
    focus: A 3px dashed grape outline offset 4px.
    tone: Cheerful and kind while facts stay exact, such as Good morning, Mara!, Uh-oh and What's new.
